#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/contributing.rst:2
msgid "为 AgentSociety 2 贡献"
msgstr "Contributing to AgentSociety 2"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/contributing.rst:4
msgid "问题报告应尽量让维护者能复现；改文档时，请同时说明适用版本、实际操作入口与验证方式。"
msgstr ""
"Make issue reports reproducible. Documentation changes should identify the applicable"
" version, actual entry points and validation performed."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/contributing.rst:6
msgid ""
"本页提供贡献入口；安装、检查与构建命令统一维护在 :doc:`development`，完整 PR 与发布约定见仓库的 `CONTRIBUTING.md "
"<https://github.com/tsinghua-fib-lab/agentsociety/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md>`_。"
msgstr ""
"This page provides contribution entry points. Installation, checks and build commands"
" are maintained in :doc:`development`; full PR and release conventions are in the "
"repository `CONTRIBUTING.md <https://github.com/tsinghua-fib-"
"lab/agentsociety/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md>`_."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/contributing.rst:9
msgid "报告错误"
msgstr "Report Bugs"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/contributing.rst:11
msgid "报告错误时，请包括："
msgstr "When reporting bugs, please include:"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/contributing.rst:13
msgid "Python 版本"
msgstr "Python version"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/contributing.rst:14
msgid "AgentSociety 2 版本"
msgstr "AgentSociety 2 version"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/contributing.rst:15
msgid "最小的可重现示例"
msgstr "Minimal reproducible example"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/contributing.rst:16
msgid "预期行为与实际行为"
msgstr "Expected vs actual behavior"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/contributing.rst:17
msgid "任何错误消息或回溯"
msgstr "Any error messages or tracebacks"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/contributing.rst:20
msgid "提交更改"
msgstr "Submit Changes"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/contributing.rst:22
msgid "修改应说明具体问题、预期行为与验证结果。行为变更补充相应测试，文档和界面变更同步检查示例、翻译与图片引用。"
msgstr ""
"Describe the concrete problem, expected behavior and validation results. Add "
"appropriate tests for behavior changes, and check examples, translations and image "
"references when changing documentation or UI."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/contributing.rst:24
msgid "新增环境或智能体：参阅 :doc:`custom_modules`。"
msgstr "New environments or agents: see :doc:`custom_modules`."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/contributing.rst:25
msgid "新增智能体技能：参阅 :doc:`skill_guide`。"
msgstr "New agent skills: see :doc:`skill_guide`."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/contributing.rst:26
msgid "运行测试、检查与构建文档：参阅 :doc:`development`。"
msgstr "Tests, checks and documentation builds: see :doc:`development`."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/contributing.rst:27
msgid "公开 Python 接口应提供文档字符串，说明参数、返回值、异常与必要的使用条件。同一模块保持一种格式；现有 reST 字段与 NumPy 风格都可由文档构建解析。"
msgstr ""
"Public Python interfaces should document parameters, return values, exceptions, and relevant "
"usage conditions. Keep a consistent style within a module; the documentation builder supports "
"both reST fields and NumPy-style docstrings."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/contributing.rst:29
msgid ""
"格式参考 `PEP 257 <https://peps.python.org/pep-0257/>`_ 与 `NumPy 文档字符串指南 "
"<https://numpydoc.readthedocs.io/en/latest/format.html>`_。函数名、参数名与示例必须与代码一致，说明文字随文档语言提供翻译。"
msgstr ""
"See `PEP 257 <https://peps.python.org/pep-0257/>`_ and the `NumPy docstring guide "
"<https://numpydoc.readthedocs.io/en/latest/format.html>`_. Function names, parameter names, and "
"examples must match the code. Provide translations of explanatory text for each documentation "
"language."

